{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/96165abfeb4d22e3ba813a267fcc9dd5.avif?t=1762141807\" width=1024 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 4th chapter of the Italian inventor's puzzle series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the codes, unlock the Cryptex, and escape the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/76c5ccf3e3b57f35ac6e8feeb3a50972.avif?t=1762141807\" width=1024 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 4</strong> is an escape room game with 50 unique riddles written on a book. The more you go on, the harder the puzzles become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/32b8063549fcb75c35f5ce88bc6075d5.avif?t=1762141807\" width=1024 height=272 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 unique handcrafted puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Astonishing graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating background music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of puzzles, math, brain teasers, mind games and IQ tests, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong>\u00a04 is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 Enigmas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108780/488bc